  "text_pages": [
    "Hostel – Saintgits Group of Institutions\n×\nEvent Calendar\nHostel\nSAINTGITS has an excellent hostel facility. The college has separate and secure residential facilities for both boys and girls. Accommodation at Saintgits consists of 6 separate hostel blocks. It has good infrastructure which makes students feel comfortable and find a homely atmosphere. Proximity to the city means that the students are housed in a hostel which has a serene and calm atmosphere and yet have access to the city. Detailed thought and consideration has gone in to provide utmost comfort to the students with more personal space provided in an ideal location. We believe in the aphorism ‘Healthy minds dwell in healthy bodies’ and to that end students are encouraged to use the sports facilities available in the hostel blocks. Thus a perfect blend of sports and academics ensure the all-round development of every student in Saintgits.\nFor more details contact:\nGeorge Punnoose,\nFood & Residence Officer(FRO),\nMobile: 8129496878\nAdmissions – Enquire Now!\n♿\nHigh Contrast\nDyslexia-Friendly Font\nA+\nA-\nHighlight Links\nLarge Cursor\nLine Height\nText Spacing\nReset"
  ],
